Description: Spotlight-style launcher: find apps, settings, files and folders
 Press a shortcut, type a few letters and open an application, a settings
 panel, a file or a folder. A resident per-user daemon keeps the index of
 file names and paths in memory and follows changes as they happen; file
 contents are never read. The GTK 4 popup lists running applications' open
 windows (on X11) and shows the selected item's details beside the results.
 .
 Installing this package also adds Torchlight's signed APT repository, so the
 system's update manager installs new versions.

